  "title": "Cherry Cobbler Muffins",
  "description": "With cherries baked inside and on top, and a streusel topping this recipe has all the best of cherry cobbler in a muffin.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:12:13-04:00",
